WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The Adaptive Traffic Management System starts, and I select the vehicle input option.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I enter the number of vehicles waiting in the North and South lanes.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Next, I enter the vehicle counts for the East and West lanes.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The system processes the traffic information and calculates the traffic score.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The system selects the North lane for a green light and displays the decision breakdown.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The dashboard shows the vehicle counts and waiting times for each direction.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
After five cycles, the system reports that all lanes are cleared and stops.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The menu provides options for automatic mode, manual mode, analytics, and exit.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
The analytics section displays average vehicles per lane and identifies the busiest lane.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.800
The final results show traffic information and emergency event records.
